    "body": "Yeah, this is an unfortunate side effect of 81f1c7bf8fba31164136e2845d3432c3045f2eef where I split into a partial interface just to be able to say \"If the navigator compatibility mode is Gecko, then the user agent must also support the following partial interface\".\n\nIIRC, all that matters for compat is whether `taintEnabled()` is present, and this is the best I could come up with. Will try `<!-- not obsolete -->`.\n",
